msgid "joke/event_1"
msgstr ""
"If your dog ever starts glowing, report to medical. Or don't. You didn't "
"hear this from me."

msgid "joke/event_10"
msgstr ""
"The dog passed swim class with flying colors. The soldier? Not so much."

msgid "joke/event_11"
msgstr "It was a tactical extraction... of snacks."

msgid "joke/event_12"
msgstr ""
"Who needs snake repellents when you have a tail that wags and a bark that "
"scares?"

msgid "joke/event_13"
msgstr "Hoarding junk? No way, more like curating morale-boosting artifacts!"

msgid "joke/event_14"
msgstr ""
"We don't know what it runs on, but we’re guessing tennis balls and chaos."

msgid "joke/event_15"
msgstr ""
"Forget mine detectors, sometimes all you need is sharp eyes and a wagging "
"tail."

msgid "joke/event_16"
msgstr "Your dog has officially become the squad's most reliable food scout."

msgid "joke/event_17"
msgstr ""
"Nobody knows where it came from, but morale’s up and cheese supplies are "
"down."

msgid "joke/event_18"
msgstr "Their last transmission? \"Bark once for danger, twice for reload.\""

msgid "joke/event_19"
msgstr "He wasn’t trespassing. He was just very lost. And armed."

msgid "joke/event_2"
msgstr ""
"Looks like someone finally cracked the secret to speeding up "
"bureaucracy—four paws and no questions."

msgid "joke/event_20"
msgstr "Forget sensors—install a dog next to every pipe instead."

msgid "joke/event_21"
msgstr ""
"You know it's serious when a dog has better supply chains than the logistics"
" team."

msgid "joke/event_22"
msgstr "Not even our top mechanics passed the wrench that fast."

msgid "joke/event_23"
msgstr "When nature strikes, send in the bark unit."

msgid "joke/event_24"
msgstr ""
"The only crew member to officially qualify as both \"combat ready\" and \"a "
"very good doggy.\""

msgid "joke/event_25"
msgstr "Hey, if the toy starts moving on its own… it's your shift now."

msgid "joke/event_26"
msgstr "Live ammo at training? Good thing your dog double-checks."

msgid "joke/event_27"
msgstr "Recruit of the month: four legs, no shovel, lots of dirt."

msgid "joke/event_28"
msgstr ""
"Calling a dog a \"chef\" is a stretch, but tails make for excellent stirring"
" tools."

msgid "joke/event_29"
msgstr "Doctor's orders: Two sets of pills and one good pupper per room."

msgid "joke/event_3"
msgstr "No forklift license, but still plenty of drive."

msgid "joke/event_30"
msgstr ""
"Mopping? Check. Dusting? Check. Shedding? Double check. Housekeeping "
"approved!"

msgid "joke/event_4"
msgstr ""
"Your dog either found a secret stash… or decided to set up a whole new "
"garage."

msgid "joke/event_5"
msgstr ""
"Turns out, the most effective formula for crowd dispersal is fermented fish "
"plus four legs."

msgid "joke/event_6"
msgstr ""
"A dog and a cat working together? The apocalypse must be ahead of schedule."

msgid "joke/event_7"
msgstr ""
"If your dog starts guarding spare parts, don't worry—it just wants a "
"promotion to junior mechanic."

msgid "joke/event_8"
msgstr "What do you call a howling dog under a full moon? A \"werewhine.\""

msgid "joke/event_9"
msgstr "Fire drills save lives. Dogs, apparently, save crews."

msgid "rewards/synergy_value"
msgstr "+"

msgid "rewards/title"
msgstr "Lost, but not gone:"

msgid "submit"
msgstr "Got it!"

msgid "text/event_1"
msgstr ""
"A {{@ style (color $color)}}stranger {{/}}in a {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}formal {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}suit {{/}}approaches you. "
"\"Your {{@ style (color $color)}}dog {{/}}has assisted in the {{@ style "
"(color $color)}}search {{/}}and {{@ style (color $color)}}containment "
"{{/}}of a {{@ style (color $color)}}dangerous {{/}}{{@ style (color "
"$color)}}object{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}The data about "
"this incident will be {{@ style (color $color)}}deleted {{/}}from all {{@ "
"style (color $color)}}logs{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}Thank"
" you for your assistance.\" The man hands you a {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}package {{/}}and leaves the {{@ style (color $color)}}Garage{{/}}."

msgid "text/event_10"
msgstr ""
"During a {{@ style (color $color)}}combat {{/}}{{@ style (color "
"$color)}}exercise {{/}}on the {{@ style (color $color)}}water{{/}}, one of "
"the {{@ style (color $color)}}soldiers {{/}}got {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}tangled {{/}}in the {{@ style (color $color)}}mooring {{/}}{{@ "
"style (color $color)}}ropes {{/}}and {{@ style (color $color)}}fell {{/}}{{@"
" style (color $color)}}in{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. "
"{{/}}{{/}}Luckily, your {{@ style (color $color)}}dog {{/}}was nearby and "
"managed to {{@ style (color $color)}}pull {{/}}the {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}drowning {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}man {{/}}to {{@ style "
"(color $color)}}safety{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}The story"
" quickly became a symbol of {{@ style (color $color)}}courage "
"{{/}}throughout the {{@ style (color $color)}}unit{{/}}."

msgid "text/event_11"
msgstr ""
"You noticed your {{@ style (color $color)}}dog {{/}}running out of the {{@ "
"style (color $color)}}warehouse {{/}}with a {{@ style (color $color)}}small "
"bag {{/}}in its {{@ style (color $color)}}mouth{{@ style (color "
"$defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}As you prepared to {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}scold {{/}}him for {{@ style (color $color)}}stealing {{/}}{{@ "
"style (color $color)}}supplies{{/}}, the {{@ style (color $color)}}custodian"
" {{/}}chuckled, \"I can't help but forgive such a good {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}pooch{{/}}.\" Looks like some extra {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}training {{/}}in {{@ style (color $color)}}manners {{/}}couldn't "
"hurt, though."

msgid "text/event_12"
msgstr ""
"During a {{@ style (color $color)}}routine {{/}}{{@ style (color "
"$color)}}inspection{{/}}, {{@ style (color $color)}}soldiers {{/}}discovered"
" a {{@ style (color $color)}}snake {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}nest "
"{{/}}near one of the {{@ style (color $color)}}barracks{{@ style (color "
"$defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}While they deliberated on how to {{@ style "
"(color $color)}}handle {{/}}it, your faithful {{@ style (color $color)}}dog "
"{{/}}drove the {{@ style (color $color)}}reptiles {{/}}away with {{@ style "
"(color $color)}}barking {{/}}and {{@ style (color $color)}}fearless "
"pouncing{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}By the {{@ style (color"
" $color)}}evening{{/}}, the {{@ style (color $color)}}area {{/}}was {{@ "
"style (color $color)}}safe {{/}}again. Your {{@ style (color $color)}}dog's "
"courage {{/}}is sure to be {{@ style (color $color)}}rewarded{{/}}."

msgid "text/event_13"
msgstr ""
"You noticed that your {{@ style (color $color)}}dog {{/}}would occasionally "
"{{@ style (color $color)}}run {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}off "
"{{/}}someplace in the {{@ style (color $color)}}morning{{@ style (color "
"$defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}It turns out that some {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}pilots {{/}}have a tradition of {{@ style (color $color)}}petting "
"{{/}}the {{@ style (color $color)}}pup {{/}}for {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}good {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}luck {{/}}before {{@ style "
"(color $color)}}takeoff{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}Curious,"
" you {{@ style (color $color)}}followed {{/}}your {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}tail-{{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}wagging {{/}}{{@ style (color "
"$color)}}friend {{/}}and discovered a {{@ style (color $color)}}secret "
"{{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}stash{{/}}—a {{@ style (color $color)}}small "
"{{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}chest {{/}}filled with {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}bottle {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}caps{{/}}, {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}buttons{{/}}, and {{@ style (color $color)}}chewed-{{/}}{{@ style "
"(color $color)}}up {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}socks{{/}}."

msgid "text/event_14"
msgstr ""
"Your {{@ style (color $color)}}dog {{/}}found a {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}strange {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}device {{/}}in an {{@ style "
"(color $color)}}old {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}garage{{@ style (color "
"$defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}After it was {{@ style (color $color)}}turned "
"{{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}on{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}, "
"{{/}}{{/}}the {{@ style (color $color)}}device {{/}}began {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}processing {{/}}the {{@ style (color $color)}}toys {{/}}inside it, "
"creating completely {{@ style (color $color)}}new {{/}}{{@ style (color "
"$color)}}items{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}During all the "
"{{@ style (color $color)}}transformations{{/}}, you managed to get a couple "
"of {{@ style (color $color)}}useful {{/}}{{@ style (color "
"$color)}}items{{/}}."

msgid "text/event_15"
msgstr ""
"During {{@ style (color $color)}}exercises {{/}}at the {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}training {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}ground{{/}}, several {{@ "
"style (color $color)}}tanks {{/}}ran into a field scattered with {{@ style "
"(color $color)}}dummy {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}mines{{@ style (color "
"$defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}Your {{@ style (color $color)}}dog {{/}}darted "
"ahead, {{@ style (color $color)}}drawing {{/}}{{@ style (color "
"$color)}}attention {{/}}and helping the {{@ style (color $color)}}crews "
"{{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}notice {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}the "
"{{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}danger {{/}}in time. Thanks to your pet's {{@"
" style (color $color)}}quick {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}} reactions{{/}},"
" the {{@ style (color $color)}}tanks {{/}}{{@ style (color "
"$color)}}regrouped {{/}}and dealt with the {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}obstacles {{/}}safely. Whatever the outcome, a {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}reward {{/}}for such {{@ style (color $color)}}bravery {{/}}is "
"guaranteed."

msgid "text/event_16"
msgstr ""
"While {{@ style (color $color)}}exploring {{/}}the {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}Garage{{/}}, your {{@ style (color $color)}}dog {{/}}sniffed out a "
"{{@ style (color $color)}}stash {{/}}of {{@ style (color $color)}}old "
"rations {{/}}hidden behind some {{@ style (color $color)}}crates{{@ style "
"(color $defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}The {{@ style (color $color)}}soldiers "
"{{/}}had a good laugh at the {{@ style (color $color)}}{{@ style (color "
"$defaultColor)}}\"{{/}}treasure {{@ style (color "
"$defaultColor)}}\"{{/}}{{/}}and handed it over to the {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}quartermaster{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}Your {{@ "
"style (color $color)}}dog {{/}}was promised a {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}reward {{/}}for the {{@ style (color $color)}}unexpected {{/}}{{@ "
"style (color $color)}}find{{/}}."

msgid "text/event_17"
msgstr ""
"You heard a {{@ style (color $color)}}noise {{/}}coming from the {{@ style "
"(color $color)}}barracks{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}As you "
"approached, you saw {{@ style (color $color)}}soldiers {{/}}gathered around,"
" watching your {{@ style (color $color)}}dog {{/}}{{@ style (color "
"$color)}}fight {{/}}a huge, {{@ style (color $color)}}muscle-{{/}}{{@ style "
"(color $color)}}bound {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}mouse{{@ style (color "
"$defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}At one point, everyone got {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}distracted {{/}}by an {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}announcement{{/}}—and when they came back, the {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}freakish {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}rodent {{/}}had {{@ style "
"(color $color)}}vanished{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}In "
"gratitude for such an {{@ style (color $color)}}entertaining {{/}}{{@ style "
"(color $color)}}spectacle{{/}}, the {{@ style (color $color)}}troops "
"{{/}}gave your {{@ style (color $color)}}dog {{/}}a couple of {{@ style "
"(color $color)}}useful {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}items{{/}}."

msgid "text/event_18"
msgstr ""
"While {{@ style (color $color)}}exploring {{/}}the {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}old {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}command {{/}}{{@ style (color "
"$color)}}hall{{/}}, your {{@ style (color $color)}}dog {{/}}began {{@ style "
"(color $color)}}barking {{/}}at a {{@ style (color $color)}}dusty "
"portrait{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}A little {{@ style "
"(color $color)}}brushing{{/}}, and a {{@ style (color $color)}}note "
"{{/}}fell down from behind the {{@ style (color $color)}}frame{{/}}.{{br}}It"
" spoke of a {{@ style (color $color)}}forgotten {{/}}{{@ style (color "
"$color)}}tank {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}unit {{/}}that {{@ style (color"
" $color)}}vanished {{/}}during {{@ style (color $color)}}night {{/}}{{@ "
"style (color $color)}}maneuvers{{/}}—their last known {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}call {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}sign {{/}}was {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}Iron {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}Paw{{/}}."

msgid "text/event_19"
msgstr ""
"During another {{@ style (color $color)}}patrol {{/}}around the {{@ style "
"(color $color)}}territory{{/}}, your {{@ style (color $color)}}dog "
"{{/}}suddenly {{@ style (color $color)}}darted {{/}}into the {{@ style "
"(color $color)}}bushes {{/}}and {{@ style (color $color)}}flushed {{/}}{{@ "
"style (color $color)}}out {{/}}a lurking {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}stranger{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}The {{@ style "
"(color $color)}}patrol {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}detained {{/}}the {{@ "
"style (color $color)}}intruder{{/}}, and the {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}incident {{/}}was {{@ style (color $color)}}logged {{/}}for further"
" {{@ style (color $color)}}investigation{{/}}."

msgid "text/event_2"
msgstr ""
"The {{@ style (color $color)}}dog {{/}}runs toward you, wagging its {{@ "
"style (color $color)}}tail{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. "
"{{/}}{{/}}There's a stack of {{@ style (color $color)}}papers {{/}}clenched "
"in its {{@ style (color $color)}}teeth{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. "
"{{/}}{{/}}At first glance, they look like {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}reports{{/}}, {{@ style (color $color)}}tables{{/}}, and other {{@ "
"style (color $color)}}documentation{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. "
"{{/}}{{/}}The guys at the {{@ style (color $color)}}office {{/}}will "
"probably be glad to have them back."

msgid "text/event_20"
msgstr ""
"While {{@ style (color $color)}}walking {{/}}around the {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}area{{/}}, your {{@ style (color $color)}}dog {{/}}suddenly started"
" {{@ style (color $color)}}barking {{/}}at one of the {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}water pipes{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}After {{@ "
"style (color $color)}}technicians {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}inspected "
"{{/}}the {{@ style (color $color)}}premises{{/}}, they discovered a {{@ "
"style (color $color)}}fault {{/}}that could have led to a major {{@ style "
"(color $color)}}system {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}failure{{/}}."

msgid "text/event_21"
msgstr ""
"Your {{@ style (color $color)}}dog {{/}}brought you a {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}bag {{/}}filled with all sorts of {{@ style (color $color)}}odd, "
"{{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}useful {{/}}{{@ style (color "
"$color)}}things{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}Despite your "
"best efforts, you couldn't {{@ style (color $color)}}figure out {{/}}where "
"it might have {{@ style (color $color)}}come {{/}}{{@ style (color "
"$color)}}from{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}Your {{@ style "
"(color $color)}}four-{{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}legged {{/}}{{@ style "
"(color $color)}}friend {{/}}just sat nearby, looking {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}smug {{/}}and perfectly {{@ style (color $color)}}content {{/}}for "
"the rest of the {{@ style (color $color)}}day{{/}}."

msgid "text/event_22"
msgstr ""
"The {{@ style (color $color)}}mechanics {{/}}managed to {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}teach {{/}}your {{@ style (color $color)}}dog {{/}}to {{@ style "
"(color $color)}}retrieve {{/}}and {{@ style (color $color)}}identify "
"{{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}tools{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. "
"{{/}}{{/}}The {{@ style (color $color)}}prodigious {{/}}{{@ style (color "
"$color)}}pooch {{/}}spent the entire {{@ style (color $color)}}day {{/}}{{@ "
"style (color $color)}}working {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}alongside "
"{{/}}them, confidently {{@ style (color $color)}}bringing {{/}}the right {{@"
" style (color $color)}}gear {{/}}like a seasoned {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}crew {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}member{{/}}."

msgid "text/event_23"
msgstr ""
"A {{@ style (color $color)}}dead {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}tree "
"{{/}}fell on one of the {{@ style (color $color)}}guards {{/}}during a {{@ "
"style (color $color)}}patrol{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. "
"{{/}}{{/}}Your {{@ style (color $color)}}dog {{/}}not only {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}ran {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}to {{/}}{{@ style (color "
"$color)}}get {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}help {{/}}but also {{@ style "
"(color $color)}}helped {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}pull {{/}}the {{@ "
"style (color $color)}}injured {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}man {{/}}out "
"from under the {{@ style (color $color)}}trunk{{@ style (color "
"$defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}This {{@ style (color $color)}}story "
"{{/}}quickly {{@ style (color $color)}}spread {{/}}among the {{@ style "
"(color $color)}}patrol {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}squads{{/}}."

msgid "text/event_24"
msgstr ""
"Your {{@ style (color $color)}}dog {{/}}participated in an {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}award {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}ceremony {{/}}for the most "
"experienced {{@ style (color $color)}}tankers{{@ style (color "
"$defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}The dutiful {{@ style (color $color)}}dog "
"{{/}}acted as an {{@ style (color $color)}}assistant{{/}}, handing {{@ style"
" (color $color)}}medals {{/}}and {{@ style (color $color)}}gifts {{/}}to the"
" {{@ style (color $color)}}host{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. "
"{{/}}{{/}}This {{@ style (color $color)}}contribution {{/}}did not go {{@ "
"style (color $color)}}unnoticed{{/}}—it earned the {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}pup {{/}}a well-deserved {{@ style (color $color)}}reward{{/}}."

msgid "text/event_25"
msgstr ""
"Your {{@ style (color $color)}}dog {{/}}returned to {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}base {{/}}carrying a {{@ style (color $color)}}torn {{/}}{{@ style "
"(color $color)}}plush {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}fox{{@ style (color "
"$defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}Some {{@ style (color $color)}}soldiers "
"{{/}}claimed they'd heard {{@ style (color $color)}}whispering {{/}}in the "
"{{@ style (color $color)}}woods {{/}}shortly before.{{br}}Later that {{@ "
"style (color $color)}}evening{{/}}, one of them {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}recognized {{/}}the {{@ style (color $color)}}toy{{/}}—it matched "
"the {{@ style (color $color)}}fox {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}emblem "
"{{/}}of a long-{{@ style (color $color)}}disbanded {{/}}{{@ style (color "
"$color)}}recon {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}unit {{/}}that {{@ style "
"(color $color)}}vanished {{/}}years ago during {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}winter {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}maneuvers{{@ style (color "
"$defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}No {{@ style (color $color)}}records "
"{{/}}remain."

msgid "text/event_26"
msgstr ""
"During the {{@ style (color $color)}}distribution {{/}}{{@ style (color "
"$color)}}of {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}supplies {{/}}for {{@ style "
"(color $color)}}field {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}training{{/}}, your {{@"
" style (color $color)}}dog {{/}}started {{@ style (color $color)}}barking "
"{{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}aggressively{{@ style (color "
"$defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}Alarmed, the {{@ style (color $color)}}officers "
"{{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}inspected {{/}}the {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}crates {{/}}and discovered that some of the {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}equipment {{/}}was {{@ style (color $color)}}live {{/}}{{@ style "
"(color $color)}}combat {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}gear {{/}}mistakenly "
"mixed in with {{@ style (color $color)}}test {{/}}{{@ style (color "
"$color)}}batches{{/}}."

msgid "text/event_27"
msgstr ""
"During {{@ style (color $color)}}military {{/}}{{@ style (color "
"$color)}}training{{/}}, your {{@ style (color $color)}}pet {{/}}became "
"obsessed with {{@ style (color $color)}}digging {{/}}{{@ style (color "
"$color)}}trenches{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}This {{@ style"
" (color $color)}}enthusiasm {{/}}quickly {{@ style (color $color)}}spread "
"{{/}}to the {{@ style (color $color)}}recruits{{/}}, who began {{@ style "
"(color $color)}}competing {{/}}with the {{@ style (color $color)}}dog "
"{{/}}for {{@ style (color $color)}}speed {{/}}and {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}depth{{/}}—much to the {{@ style (color $color)}}instructors' "
"{{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}amusement{{/}}."

msgid "text/event_28"
msgstr ""
"Today was a {{@ style (color $color)}}home-{{/}}{{@ style (color "
"$color)}}cooking {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}day {{/}}at {{@ style (color"
" $color)}}camp{{/}}, when {{@ style (color $color)}}soldiers {{/}}were "
"allowed to {{@ style (color $color)}}prepare {{/}}{{@ style (color "
"$color)}}local {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}dishes {{/}}from available {{@"
" style (color $color)}}ingredients{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. "
"{{/}}{{/}}Your {{@ style (color $color)}}dog {{/}}spent the whole {{@ style "
"(color $color)}}day {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}running {{/}}{{@ style "
"(color $color)}}between {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}cooking {{/}}{{@ "
"style (color $color)}}stations {{/}}and {{@ style (color $color)}}helping "
"{{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}carry {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}} "
"supplies{{/}}—earning more than a few {{@ style (color $color)}}bites "
"{{/}}from {{@ style (color $color)}}friendly {{/}}{{@ style (color "
"$color)}}hands{{/}}."

msgid "text/event_29"
msgstr ""
"Today was an {{@ style (color $color)}}important {{/}}{{@ style (color "
"$color)}}day{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}Your {{@ style "
"(color $color)}}pet {{/}}spent it at the {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}hospital{{/}}, {{@ style (color $color)}}cheering {{/}}{{@ style "
"(color $color)}}up {{/}}the {{@ style (color $color)}}wounded {{/}}by "
"performing a few {{@ style (color $color)}}tricks {{/}}you'd taught them and"
" making sure to {{@ style (color $color)}}visit {{/}}each {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}soldier{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}For a while, "
"the {{@ style (color $color)}}ward {{/}}was filled with {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}laughter {{/}}and {{@ style (color $color)}}tail wags{{/}}."

msgid "text/event_3"
msgstr ""
"You watch as the {{@ style (color $color)}}dog {{/}}happily helps the {{@ "
"style (color $color)}}boys {{/}}from the {{@ style (color $color)}}warehouse"
" {{/}}carry {{@ style (color $color)}}bags {{/}}and other {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}loads{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}At the end of the"
" day, the grateful {{@ style (color $color)}}foreman {{/}}hands you a small "
"{{@ style (color $color)}}package {{/}}as thanks for the helpful pup's work."

msgid "text/event_30"
msgstr ""
"Today, your {{@ style (color $color)}}dog {{/}}helped the often-overlooked "
"{{@ style (color $color)}}service {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}staff{{@ "
"style (color $defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}The hardworking {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}hound {{/}}carried {{@ style (color $color)}}cleaning {{/}}{{@ "
"style (color $color)}}supplies {{/}}and even tried {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}dragging {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}a {{/}}{{@ style (color "
"$color)}}mop {{/}}across the {{@ style (color $color)}}floor {{/}}without "
"any help. Such {{@ style (color $color)}}clumsy {{/}}but {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}determined {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}efforts {{/}}lifted "
"everyone's {{@ style (color $color)}}spirits {{/}}for the rest of the {{@ "
"style (color $color)}}day{{/}}."

msgid "text/event_4"
msgstr ""
"The {{@ style (color $color)}}dog {{/}}dragged in a {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}wooden {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}crate {{/}}filled with odd, "
"mismatched {{@ style (color $color)}}tools{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}."
" {{/}}{{/}}No one knows where it came from, but it looks like someone {{@ "
"style (color $color)}}packed {{/}}it deliberately."

msgid "text/event_5"
msgstr ""
"The {{@ style (color $color)}}dog {{/}}found a {{@ style (color $color)}}can"
" {{/}}with a {{@ style (color $color)}}Swedish {{/}}{{@ style (color "
"$color)}}label{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}Having {{@ style "
"(color $color)}}bitten {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}the {{/}}{{@ style "
"(color $color)}}lid{{/}}, it began to mischievously {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}run {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}after {{/}}{{@ style (color "
"$color)}}the {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}soldiers{{/}}, who were {{@ "
"style (color $color)}}fleeing {{/}}from the can's {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}awful {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}smell{{@ style (color "
"$defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}One of the {{@ style (color $color)}}men "
"{{/}}running past offered you a {{@ style (color $color)}}reward {{/}}to "
"stop the {{@ style (color $color)}}torment{{/}}."

msgid "text/event_6"
msgstr ""
"One of the {{@ style (color $color)}}cooks {{/}}spent the whole day putting "
"up {{@ style (color $color)}}posters {{/}}about a {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}missing {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}kitten {{/}}around the {{@ "
"style (color $color)}}Garage{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. "
"{{/}}{{/}}Your {{@ style (color $color)}}dog {{/}}decided to help with the "
"{{@ style (color $color)}}search {{/}}and, after a few hours, found the {{@ "
"style (color $color)}}fuzzy {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}fugitive "
"{{/}}hiding near one of the {{@ style (color $color)}}barracks{{/}}."

msgid "text/event_7"
msgstr ""
"Your {{@ style (color $color)}}dog {{/}}found a {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}strange {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}device {{/}}and carried it "
"around the {{@ style (color $color)}}Garage {{/}}all day. Eventually, one of"
" the {{@ style (color $color)}}mechanics {{/}}recognized it as a {{@ style "
"(color $color)}}spare {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}tank {{/}}{{@ style "
"(color $color)}}component {{/}}and carefully took it away to the {{@ style "
"(color $color)}}workshop{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}The {{@"
" style (color $color)}}dog {{/}}seemed very proud of its {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}discovery{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}Whatever it "
"turns out to be, it looks like you'll be {{@ style (color $color)}}rewarded "
"{{/}}for the {{@ style (color $color)}}find{{/}}."

msgid "text/event_8"
msgstr ""
"Tonight was a {{@ style (color $color)}}full {{/}}{{@ style (color "
"$color)}}moon{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}Enchanted by the "
"{{@ style (color $color)}}moonlight{{/}}, the {{@ style (color $color)}}dog "
"{{/}}howled almost nonstop until {{@ style (color $color)}}morning{{@ style "
"(color $defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}The {{@ style (color $color)}}soldiers "
"{{/}}who woke up tried everything to calm the {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}pup{{/}}, but nothing seemed to work"

msgid "text/event_9"
msgstr ""
"During {{@ style (color $color)}}testing{{/}}, a {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}fire {{/}}broke out in one of the {{@ style (color "
"$color)}}tanks{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}Before anyone "
"could react, your {{@ style (color $color)}}dog {{/}}darted into the {{@ "
"style (color $color)}}burning {{/}}{{@ style (color $color)}}vehicle "
"{{/}}and helped the {{@ style (color $color)}}crew {{/}}{{@ style (color "
"$color)}}escape{{@ style (color $defaultColor)}}. {{/}}{{/}}The story of "
"such {{@ style (color $color)}}bravery {{/}}quickly spread across the {{@ "
"style (color $color)}}base{{/}}."

